{"data": [{"author_id": "1745106082790318080", "created_at": "2026-11-09T19:58:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119882230239543319"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/gGN1wH8tFj", "end": 302, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/SemiAnalysis_/status/2119882230239543319/video/1", "media_key": "7_2119882205186887680", "start": 279, "url": "https://t.co/gGN1wH8tFj"}]}, "id": "2119882230239543319", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 24, "impression_count": 12015, "like_count": 88, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 6, "retweet_count": 7}, "text": "The biggest risk to the US data center buildout is already in effect in one state.\n\n“The single biggest risk isn’t a single candidate, because in many cases both parties and candidates want developers to accept stricter terms.”\n\n“In the case of Texas, it’s a freeze that already https://t.co/gGN1wH8tFj", "url": "https://x.com/SemiAnalysis_/status/2119882230239543319"}, {"author_id": "1529761561170124800", "created_at": "2026-11-09T19:06:45.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119869320499224965"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/21BYG9sZUg", "end": 297, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/EpochAIResearch/status/2119869320499224965/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2119869317311500288", "start": 274, "url": "https://t.co/21BYG9sZUg"}]}, "id": "2119869320499224965", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 32, "impression_count": 5997, "like_count": 124, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 8, "retweet_count": 8}, "text": "We estimate that FLOP/s alone understates GB300’s inference advantage over H100 by 10×. The standard AI chip comparison misses most of what matters for inference.\n\nWe’re introducing the Inference Performance Index (IPI), a new measure that accounts for memory bandwidth and https://t.co/21BYG9sZUg", "url": "https://x.com/EpochAIResearch/status/2119869320499224965"}, {"author_id": "1353836358901501952", "created_at": "2026-11-09T19:00:21.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119867707546071125"], "